aughan, even Leonard Feather, Benny Goodman. Seemed like it was more inspira- tion for them than I had out of the house. I had to go down to Nola's and get my inspiration. Dizzy Gillespie, Miles Davis - oh, just all the musicians came here. Seemed like I was inspi- ration or something for them.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12858$8DEBC892-0EDE-4387-AF4C-194F21F0CF20", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "a8cb8b94d50e64bf02cc457e5b37dd3dcb8f0edf", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/7f2d6063335b48edf115ddc57d56bb92/670.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12858$F94DE68A-D74F-4B67-B0EB-CB81146AA4C3", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "db3e4ac07b132f776bfd997feda8610bc69d0f54", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 41, "id": "Q41"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12858$5C90C87F-1635-4955-AB80-D8D53CB19BDC", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "685aec187b152855e01ad056b5b879cb25f03b29", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 93, "id": "Q93"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12858$3271C960-6613-4818-8D94-E062B7A38AF9", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "33eabf49c5b67bcf22e11ff387a4035cb991d4a8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 50, "id": "Q50"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12858$25533C02-18E4-45AC-925C-0818AC648569", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "5590074dc8b8ef5f1293fa7ae4b6fbbe58dd6e0c", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 233, "id": "Q233"}, "type